{"id": "70", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{rivals logo, engine rumble, Adam Gilbert intro, Texas Hoops Television graphic, basketball player with medal speaking, basketball game in gym}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{rivals logo, engine rumble, Adam Gilbert intro, Texas Hoops Television graphic, basketball player with medal speaking, basketball game in gym}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video opens with a \"rivals\" logo on a perforated background accompanied by a low engine rumble and a male voice introducing himself as Adam Gilbert from Texas Hoops Television, followed by a transition to a \"Texas Hoops Television\" graphic featuring a basketball breaking through a TV screen with a basketball game in the background.\nThe video shows a basketball player in a black and blue jersey with a medal speaking to the camera in a gym, followed by a basketball game in progress with players in blue and black uniforms on a wooden court.\nThe video transitions from a \"Texas Hoops Television\" graphic showing a basketball breaking through a TV screen with a basketball game in the background to a close-up of a basketball player in a black and blue jersey with a medal speaking in a gym, followed by footage of a basketball game in progress with players in blue and black uniforms on a wooden court.\n\n\\boxed{rivals logo, engine rumble, Adam Gilbert intro, Texas Hoops Television graphic, basketball player with medal speaking, basketball game in gym}", "time_sec": 415.505, "generation_time_seconds": 264.5255, "selection_time_seconds": 148.7279, "nemotron": {"method": "gd", "step_beam_size": 2, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "r