{"id": "71", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a hat cooks food on a grill outside, accompanied by the sizzle of frying food and music as he speaks.", "pred": "\\boxed{Three men sit around a nighttime campfire while a man cooks breakfast in daylight with rhythmic music and a male voice asking \"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Three men sit around a nighttime campfire while a man cooks breakfast in daylight with rhythmic music and a male voice asking \"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\"}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe fire scene shows three men seated in camping chairs around a metal fire pit with bright orange flames and rising smoke in a dark outdoor setting at night, while the audio features rhythmic music and a male voice asking \"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\"\nA man in a hat and glasses cooks food in a black pan on a portable stove with a white spatula while vehicles and trees are visible in the background during daylight hours.\nThe fire scene depicts nighttime with three men around a metal fire pit while audio shows rhythmic music and a male voice asking about breakfast, contrasting with the subsequent daytime scene of a man cooking in a black pan on a portable stove with a white spatula.\n\n\\boxed{Three men sit around a nighttime campfire while a man cooks breakfast in daylight with rhythmic music and a male voice asking \"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\"}", "time_sec": 372.761, "generation_time_seconds": 223.0625, "selection_time_seconds": 147.0131, "nemotron": {"method": "gd", "step_beam_size": 2, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
